                <pb facs="0811" n="731" sameAs="frus:frus1902/pg731"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Memorandum from Mr. Takahira to Mr. Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Japanese Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1902-12-04"><hi rendition="#italic">December 4,
                        1902</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Copy of telegram from Baron Komura to Mr. Takahira, received December 4,
                    1902:</p>
                <p>“His Excellency Buck, while attending duck-hunting party December 4, taken
                    suddenly ill and died.</p>
                <p>“Convey to the United States Government deepest condolence of Imperial
                    Government.”</p>
            </div>
